  witness integrations/mcp/tests/project_run_cancel.test.mjs
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/fabric_project_workflow.test.mjs sends one relay over real loopback HTTP, runs real Git isolation and a Bun test, applies through the real Project owner, and reads compact and full results with deterministic injected agents
  witness packs/no-simulation/mcp-workflow-20261017/relay-source-http-fixture.json records real HTTP, current tracked and untracked source, immutable input baseline, real test and Project apply with deterministic agents under an explicit fixture dirty-path policy
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/fabric_project_workflow.test.mjs also verifies that default clean-path policy refuses the same dirty-source candidate before review expense
  witness packs/no-simulation/mcp-workflow-20261017/relay-http-fixture.json records the temporary fixture's actual task, test, apply and response-size results without claiming model quality or production effect authority
  witness packs/no-simulation/mcp-workflow-20261017/fabric-live-readback.json records the paused live broker's Project reachability, compact task read and historical-task reconciliation signal; before-and-after snapshots preserve all six tables and verify all fifty-two receipt files
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/fabric_live_witness.mjs read-only full-catalog and historical task/receipt/table continuity verifier
  witness integrations/mcp/tests/fabric_cutover.json live Python-to-Bun promotion with identical six-table row digests, 52 receipt files, fourteen tools and four prompts; Recursive, Canary and Project MCP refreshed and witnessed
  invariant migration preserves historical state and STOP controls; startup never promotes stale running rows into executable work
  known_gap measured 25 warm serial receipt reads improved p50 from 15.994291ms to 6.999ms and p95 from 18.123167ms to 16.386084ms; this is not agent throughput or a concurrent scaling benchmark
  known_gap cutover checks broker-recorded work and referenced receipts, not unrecorded reparented processes or orphan receipt files
  known_gap paid agent behavior is not exercised by migration tests; deterministic injected agents prove orchestration contracts, not model quality
  known_gap legacy estate-compiler databases may be absent; estate status/add then refuse explicitly rather than creating replacement authority
  known_gap hook bridge is ported but no active installed hook reference was found; its presence is not a live-wiring claim
  known_gap historical orphaned running rows are preserved for explicit reconciliation, never automatically resumed or relabelled
  known_gap native reviewed model work is now an account-aware producer; historical operator dispatch remains unbound and scoped session resumption still requires its original owner authority
  known_gap generic operator outputs remain bounded receipt metadata; the model owner separately admits exact retained plaintext output after fresh destination access and digest verification
  known_gap explicit source selection does not discover omitted dependencies or snapshot all concurrent changes; unselected files remain at the configured Git base, and Project can still refuse dirty-path application
  known_gap the October 17 broker remains paused by its existing STOP state and its configured mesh endpoint remains unavailable; the directly configured Project endpoint is reachable, and no paid agent task was dispatched for this verification

